{"type":"turn_end","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Perfect! Now I understand the schemas:\n\nFarmers markets:\n- state_name or state_abbr to identify state\n- farmers_markets: count of farmers markets per state\n\nCensus:\n- NAME: state name\n- SUMLEV: summary level (I need to filter to the right level, likely 40 for states and 1 for national)\n- POPESTIMATE2025: 2025 population estimate (the latest data available)\n\nI need to:\n1. Filter the census data to get just the national total (SUMLEV=1, or NAME='United States')\n2. Sum all the farmers_markets from the farmers markets table\n3. Calculate per 100,000 residents\n\nLet me first peek at what data we have in these tables to understand their structure better.","thinkingSignature":""},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01WnocFXR9tXnEmVN5xLRuz5","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"farmers_markets","compose":"source.limit(3)"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"toolu_01SyCpXVDmjeVgL8bVKopJ3R","name":"xorq_select","arguments":{"catalog_path":".xorq/catalog","on":"census_population","compose":"source.limit(3)"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"anthropic","model":"claude-haiku-4-5","usage":{"input":14,"output":371,"cacheRead":15624,"cacheWrite":1467,"totalTokens":17476,"cost":{"input":0.000014,"output":0.001855,"cacheRead":0.0015624,"cacheWrite":0.00183375,"total":0.0052651500000000006},"cacheWrite1h":0,"reasoning":181},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1786914389519,"responseId":"msg_011Ce77Fc69B4nkHjYymfA4P","rawStopReason":"tool_use"},"toolResults":[{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_01WnocFXR9tXnEmVN5xLRuz5","toolName":"xorq_select","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"state_name\",\"state_abbr\",\"farmers_markets\",\"csa_programs\",\"farm_stands\",\"snap_ebt_markets\",\"snap_ebt_pct\",\"organic_vendor_markets\",\"organic_pct\",\"markets_with_website\",\"website_pct\"\n\"California\",\"CA\",647,95,223,100,15.5,114,17.6,246,38.0\n\"New York\